BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  Long ago, in a land between mountains, there lived two villages separated by a barren valley. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    Each spring, the upstream village received sacred waters that could nourish any soil. The do) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    wnstream village possessed ancient seeds that, when watered, would multiply threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  A great drought came. The upstream elder could keep their five measures of water for themselve) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    s, or send some down the valley, trusting the downstream village would share the multiplied ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    harvest.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  The first elder, fearful, sent nothing. Both villages suffered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  The second elder sent one measure, cautiously. The downstream village returned one measure of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    grain. Both survived meagerly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  The third elder understood the sacred balance. She sent all five measures, trusting completely) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    . The water touched the ancient seeds, and fifteen measures of grain grew. The downstream el) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    der, humbled by such trust and blessed with abundance, returned eight measures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  The upstream village kept eight measures. The downstream kept seven. Both thrived.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  From that season forward, the villages prospered. They learned that the spring's gift multipli) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ed only through trust, and abundance returned only through gratitude. The valley bloomed gre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    en, teaching all who witnessed: when trust flows freely and generosity returns home, scarcit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    y transforms into plenty for all.) Tj ET
