BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  In the beginning, the River and the Rain lived separately. The Rain dwelt in clouds above, hol) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ding precious waters. The River flowed below, carrying life to the valleys.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  One day, the Great Spirit spoke: "You are kin, yet divided. Share your gifts, and abundance sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    all multiply.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  The Rain was uncertain. "If I release my waters to the River below, what if nothing returns?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  But the Rain took courage and let its waters fall. When they touched the River, they tripled i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    n abundance. The valley bloomed. The creatures drank. Life flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  The River, now overflowing with plenty, understood its duty. Through evaporation, it returned ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    waters skyward, replenishing the Rain's clouds. Not equal to what it received-the River need) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    ed sustenance too-but enough to honor the Rain's trust and ensure future gifts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  Season after season, they continued this sacred exchange. When the Rain gave generously, the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    iver returned faithfully. Both prospered. The valley thrived.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  But when either grew selfish-the Rain withholding or the River returning nothing-drought desce) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    nded upon them both.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  Thus the Great Spirit taught: *Trust given and honored multiplies; trust broken diminishes all) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    .*) Tj ET
