BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. Each dawn, the River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (     Spirit granted the upstream village five silver stones. The villagers faced a choice: keep ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    the stones, or cast them into the flowing waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  When stones touched the river, they multiplied threefold by the time they reached the downstre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    am village. Those who received the stones could then choose: keep all the bounty, or return ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    some upstream as gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  At first, the upstream village hoarded their stones, sending nothing. Both villages remained p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    oor. Then one brave elder cast all five stones into the current. Downstream rejoiced at rece) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    iving fifteen stones, and in gratitude, returned eight upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  The elder learned: by giving five and receiving eight back, both villages prospered. When down) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    stream returned generously, trust grew like roots intertwining beneath the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  But when downstream grew greedy and returned nothing, the flow ceased. The river taught that p) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    rosperity flows both ways-the gift must complete its circle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  The wisest generation learned balance: send enough to create abundance, return enough to susta) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    in trust. For the river's magic lies not in the stones themselves, but in the current of rec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    iprocity that carries them endlessly between shores, enriching all who honor the flow.) Tj ET
