BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Sacred Fountain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Between them lay a Sacred F) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ountain with miraculous properties: any offering placed within its waters would triple befor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    e reaching the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  The First Village possessed five golden seeds each season. They faced a choice: keep the seeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (     and plant them in rocky soil, or trust them to the Fountain's magic and the neighboring vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    lage's honor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  When brave souls sent their seeds through the waters, they multiplied to fifteen. The Second V) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    illage then decided how many seeds to return across the valley. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  The wisest elders taught: "When gifts flow through the Fountain, abundance grows for all. The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    sender shows faith; the receiver shows gratitude. Neither should exploit the other's trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  Some seasons, villages sent generously and received generously in return. Both prospered. Othe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    r seasons, fear or greed broke the cycle, and the valley remained barren.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  The Fountain taught that wealth multiplies not through hoarding, but through the sacred dance ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    of trust and reciprocity. When both villages honored this balance, the seeds they shared eve) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ntually grew into bridges across the divide.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  The Fountain still flows, waiting for those wise enough to recognize that true abundance requi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    res both courage to give and integrity to return.) Tj ET
