BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  In the beginning, two springs emerged from the mountain-one in the valley of Dawn, one in the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    valley of Dusk. Each spring gave its keeper five cups of water daily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
