BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      In the beginning, the River flowed alone through the valley, keeping all its waters to its) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        elf. The Rain would fall from the sky, offering droplets to the River's course, but the ) Tj ET
