BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Between them lay a Sacr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ed Fountain with miraculous properties: any offering placed within its waters would trip) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        le before reaching the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The First Village possessed five golden seeds each season. They faced a choice: keep the s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        eeds and plant them in rocky soil, or trust them to the Fountain's magic and the neighbo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        ring village's honor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      When brave souls sent their seeds through the waters, they multiplied to fifteen. The Seco) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        nd Village then decided how many seeds to return across the valley. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      The wisest elders taught: "When gifts flow through the Fountain, abundance grows for all. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        The sender shows faith; the receiver shows gratitude. Neither should exploit the other's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (         trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      Some seasons, villages sent generously and received generously in return. Both prospered. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        Other seasons, fear or greed broke the cycle, and the valley remained barren.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      The Fountain taught that wealth multiplies not through hoarding, but through the sacred da) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        nce of trust and reciprocity. When both villages honored this balance, the seeds they sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        ared eventually grew into bridges across the divide.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      The Fountain still flows, waiting for those wise enough to recognize that true abundance r) Tj ET
