BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      The First Village possessed five golden seeds each season. They faced a choice: keep the s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        eeds and plant them in rocky soil, or trust them to the Fountain's magic and the neighbo) Tj ET
