BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      The wisest elders taught: "When gifts flow through the Fountain, abundance grows for all. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        The sender shows faith; the receiver shows gratitude. Neither should exploit the other's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (         trust.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      Some seasons, villages sent generously and received generously in return. Both prospered. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        Other seasons, fear or greed broke the cycle, and the valley remained barren.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
