BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        nce of trust and reciprocity. When both villages honored this balance, the seeds they sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ared eventually grew into bridges across the divide.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
