BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      One day, the Great Spirit spoke: "You are kin, yet divided. Share your gifts, and abundanc) Tj ET
