BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      But the Rain took courage and let its waters fall. When they touched the River, they tripl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        ed in abundance. The valley bloomed. The creatures drank. Life flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      The River, now overflowing with plenty, understood its duty. Through evaporation, it retur) Tj ET
