BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      Season after season, they continued this sacred exchange. When the Rain gave generously, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        he River returned faithfully. Both prospered. The valley thrived.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
