BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. Each dawn, the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        iver Spirit granted the upstream village five silver stones. The villagers faced a choic) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        e: keep the stones, or cast them into the flowing waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
