BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        stream village. Those who received the stones could then choose: keep all the bounty, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         return some upstream as gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      At first, the upstream village hoarded their stones, sending nothing. Both villages remain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        ed poor. Then one brave elder cast all five stones into the current. Downstream rejoiced) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         at receiving fifteen stones, and in gratitude, returned eight upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      The elder learned: by giving five and receiving eight back, both villages prospered. When ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        downstream returned generously, trust grew like roots intertwining beneath the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      But when downstream grew greedy and returned nothing, the flow ceased. The river taught th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        at prosperity flows both ways-the gift must complete its circle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      The wisest generation learned balance: send enough to create abundance, return enough to s) Tj ET
