BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      Myth: The River learned there are many paths to abundance, not only one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      In the First Season, the River gave everything-all five measures-to the Sky. The Sky, hono) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        red by such faith, returned half. Both prospered equally, seven and eight portions flowi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        ng between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      In the Second Season, the River met a different Sky. This Sky had given three measures in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        its own land and received generous returns. It knew trust, but also caution's value.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      The River again gave all five measures, remembering: "The cycle begins with courage." The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        waters tripled, and the new Sky faced its choice with fifteen measures swirling in its h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        eights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      The wise understand: whether you send three or five, the sacred mathematics remain-generos) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        ity multiplied can lift both travelers higher than hoarding ever could. The question is ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        not the precise measure of first trust, but whether the cycle completes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      The River learned to read the seasons. Some partners would respond to total faith, others ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        to measured trust. What mattered was not matching exactly, but reading the pattern and r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        esponding with wisdom.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      The greatest abundance came not from one perfect exchange, but from learning each partner') Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        s rhythm and dancing accordingly. Trust builds through repetition, not calculation. The ) Tj ET
