BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        ons.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      The Oak stood different. From its first awakening, the Oak released all five acorns into e) Tj ET
