BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      Then Phoenix and Oak met. The Phoenix saw the Oak's history: unbroken pattern of maximum t) Tj ET
