BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    All five stones flowed to the Eight-Stone River. Fifteen arrived. Eight returned-honest, gen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      erous, exactly as promised.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    "You profited three while I profit one when our roles reverse," observed the River. "Does th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      is bother you?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    "No," replied the Spirit. "You honored your pattern with integrity. I honored mine. Both of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      us sent with complete trust. Both rejected greed. The difference of one stone matters far ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      less than our shared foundation-neither of us calculates, neither withholds.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    The valley whispered: "Perfect symmetry with another nine-returner creates the highest prosp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      erity. But trust with an eight-returner who never wavers? That too is sacred. Send with co) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      mplete faith regardless of return. Your consistency is your integrity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    The Spirit understood: Generosity isn't conditional on receiving equal generosity. It's a ch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      osen path, maintained always.) Tj ET
