BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    "We are mirrors," the Phoenix realized, "but different from the Guardian's mirror of Eight. ) Tj ET
