BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    For nine seasons, the Guardian had walked the River of Eight without deviation-sending five ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      orbs with complete trust, returning eight from fifteen received. Through varied partnershi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ps, this rhythm never faltered. Phoenix-spirits who returned nine were honored. Mirror-sou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ls who returned eight were celebrated. All who sent with courage and returned with generos) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ity earned respect.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    But in the ninth season, facing a true mirror-soul for the third time, the Guardian felt som) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ething transcendent. This was not just similarity-this was profound recognition. Two spiri) Tj ET
