BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      as Phoenix always did. Rain profited four. Phoenix kept six. The dance continued.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    When seasons turned and Phoenix sent five flames, Rain would receive fifteen and return nine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      . Phoenix would profit four. Rain would keep six. Perfect reciprocity-each gaining four wh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      en sending, each keeping six when receiving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    The Great Spirit spoke: "See the beauty of matching covenants? When River and Rain danced, o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ne gained three while the other gained four-still harmonious, still generous, but asymmetr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ic. When Phoenix and Rain dance, perfect balance emerges. Both profit four when vulnerable) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      . Both keep six when powerful. This is the reward when two souls share not just commitment) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (       to trust, but identical measurements of generosity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
